#: manual/api/differentiation.md:12
msgid "`Some(weights)`, where `weights[i][k]` is the weight of `nodes[i]` in the approximation of the `k`-th derivative at `center`, for `k` from `0` to `derivative_order`. Returns `None` if `derivative_order` is negative, if there are not more than `derivative_order` nodes, or if two nodes coincide."
msgstr "`Some(weights)`。`weights[i][k]` は `center` における `k` 階導関数の近似での `nodes[i]` の重みで、`k` は `0` から `derivative_order` までです。`derivative_order` が負の場合、節点が `derivative_order` 個より多くない場合、または 2 つの節点が一致する場合は `None` を返します。"

